<title>ITALY: Republic of Italy to issue long-term mark bond.</title>
<headline>Republic of Italy to issue long-term mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Republic of Italy intends to issue a long-term bond denominated in marks, a statement from the Italian Treasury said.</p>
<p>It said Deutsche Bank Morgan Grenfell and SBC Warburg would act as joint bookrunners of the issue.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
